# Scratch/temp files
# `scratch_*.ts` only matched files at the repo root, so everything inside the
# scratch/ DIRECTORY was committed. scratch/test-turso-web.ts shipped a live
# Turso auth token to origin/main because of this gap.
scratch/
scratch_*.ts
scratch_*.js

# Session dumps (agent transcripts pasted as context — stay on disk, never pushed)
previous_session_back.md
session-ses_ef88.md

# Full session transcripts dumped at the repo root for an agent to read.
# `big_rebase.md` was a 45 MB transcript (system prompts, tool JSON, diffs,
# and — because it embedded the transcript of a gitleaks run — copies of the
# very findings the scanner reports). It was unreferenced by any code or doc and
# was sitting UNIGNORED, one `git add -A` away from landing in history. These
# belong outside the repository entirely, not merely uncommitted.
big_rebase.md
sess_prev.md
sess_*.md
session_*.md
session-*.md
typecheck-out.txt
test-output.txt

