./.gemini/
./.*

.vercel
.env*

testsprite_tests\tmp\config.json
testsprite_tests/tmp/
testsprite_tests/tmp/config.json
# Local tool caches (deno-lsp npm/registry cache under apps/gateway/.cache is
# ~1.9 GB / 113k files — untracked AND unignored it made `git add -A` a
# footgun and made scripts/principle-lints.ts run for minutes emitting
# "Filename too long" before it could reach product code).
.cache/
**/.cache/